# Vault UI

Before editing files under `client/`, read **`client/DESIGN.md`**.

Quick rules:

- Colours: inline `var(--color-bg|surface|border|primary|text|muted)` — no Tailwind palette or `dark:` classes
- Status only: amber `#b45309` / red `#ef4444` / green `#166534` (see DESIGN.md)
- Hover: `hover:opacity-60|70` only — no colour-shift hover
- Icons: `getIcon()` from `IconProvider` — never direct Lucide imports
- No shared `<Button>` — inline buttons like `PageToolbar` / `ConfirmModal`
- Long ops (>2s): `useProcessingStore` + `ProcessingModal`; instant CRUD: toasts
- Reuse `PageToolbar`, `ConfirmModal`, `OverflowMenu` before custom chrome

Reference: `MemoryPage.jsx`, `SettingsPage.jsx`, `ConfirmModal.jsx`.
